&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;{&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;your_responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;: [&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1n50upo&quot; data-start=&quot;1129&quot; data-end=&quot;1293&quot;&gt;Work on Broker / Investment products and journeys, with an initial focus on improving and further iterating on a live, high-impact investment product post launch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1j6zvoa&quot; data-start=&quot;1294&quot; data-end=&quot;1440&quot;&gt;Pick up existing work quickly, understand what has been built, and identify what needs to improve, be clarified, tested, designed, or escalated.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1b48pat&quot; data-start=&quot;1441&quot; data-end=&quot;1538&quot;&gt;Design improvements and iterations for investment products and prepare them for implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;ucwg2s&quot; data-start=&quot;1539&quot; data-end=&quot;1683&quot;&gt;Work on existing and new investment journeys, such as savings plans, portfolio flows, product setup, product explanation, or management flows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1so3w4n&quot; data-start=&quot;1684&quot; data-end=&quot;1840&quot;&gt;Make complex investment decisions easy for customers to understand: what they are doing, why it matters, what the implications are, and what happens next.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1jtklph&quot; data-start=&quot;1841&quot; data-end=&quot;1958&quot;&gt;Use feedback, data, research, support input, and stakeholder input to identify real customer and business problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;tuztwo&quot; data-start=&quot;1959&quot; data-end=&quot;2061&quot;&gt;Look beyond assigned tasks and identify useful opportunities for existing flows and future features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;sbd5m2&quot; data-start=&quot;2062&quot; data-end=&quot;2213&quot;&gt;Work closely with the Design Manager: spar on direction, bring topics for discussion, and take ownership of topics that need senior design attention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;fuvlaq&quot; data-start=&quot;2214&quot; data-end=&quot;2407&quot;&gt;Know when a workshop, design sprint, critique, sparring session, or co-creation session is useful, and turn it into clear output such as decisions, concepts, priorities, flows, or next steps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;5s1wtj&quot; data-start=&quot;2408&quot; data-end=&quot;2548&quot;&gt;Work closely with Product Owners (POs), native engineers, web engineers, backend teams, Business, Legal / Compliance, and other designers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;d925ff&quot; data-start=&quot;2549&quot; data-end=&quot;2701&quot;&gt;Prepare designs with enough detail for implementation, including flows, states, edge cases, accessibility, content structure, and interaction details.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ijyuq3&quot; data-start=&quot;2702&quot; data-end=&quot;2817&quot;&gt;Challenge unclear requirements or existing UX patterns when they make the experience harder to understand or use.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1xoz5gc&quot; data-start=&quot;2818&quot; data-end=&quot;2903&quot;&gt;Document learnings, patterns, or design system needs so other teams can reuse them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
